SUMMARY:Upcycled Journal Workshop — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, Cal
 ifornia
DTSTART:20261021T000000
DTEND:20261022T000000
UID:d036f0b05963669fdee0531e276e1ccc@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Upcycled Journal Workshop\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n     
      $70.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nUpcycled Journal WorkshopWednes
 day\, October 21st\, 6:00-9:00pmAges 13+ Attendance $60 + Materials $10 = 
 $70.00 Registration Fee Join us for a fun and creative workshop turning re
 cycled cereal/snack boxes into a unique handmade journal. Students will re
 move parts of the boxes until we have what we will use as our cover.  Then
 \, using miscellaneous papers\, we fold these into the pages of our journa
 ls. With simple book-binding skills using a needle and waxed thread\, we w
 ill stitch the pages into our covers. We will also decorate the covers of 
 our journals with collage papers and/or paint. Examples will be shown thro
 ughout the class\, and step-by-step instruction with all materials being p
 rovided\, this class is great for beginners looking to get started in upcy
 cled crafting. Short exercises to boost your creativity and journal prompt
 s are also included. Whether you are a beginning or seasoned artist/writer
 /crafter\, or just looking to try something new\, this is a great way to g
 et inspired and create something meaningful to you. About the Instructor: 
 Rendell Hourigan received a BBA in Marketing from Texas Tech University\, 
 and has pursued art for over 25 years focusing on sustainable mixed media.
  She has studied with artists including Chery Baird\, Jenny London\, and T
 eri Slot\, exploring drawing\, collage\, and soft pastels. She’s exhibit
 ed work at the Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, The Graton Gallery\, and h
 er SOFA district studio. Drawn to the beauty of discarded materials and pa
 ssionate about recycling\, she incorporates reclaimed materials into her w
 ork and now leads art workshops to inspire eco-conscious creativity in oth
 ers. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   
        \n            \n              \n                Add to cart
