SUMMARY:Ultra Textural Weaving on a Unique Substrate with Vicki Assegued (
 October 25th\, 2026) — Sebastopol Center For the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20261025T000000
DTEND:20261026T000000
UID:24271be0e3e73e2cf3ace9cf188a4615@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Ultra Textural Weaving on a Unique Substrate with Vicki Assegu
 ed (October 25th\, 2026)\n\n  \n    \n      \n      from $125.00\n    \n  
 \n\nRegister early to qualify for our $25.00 off early-bird registration r
 ate!Use code VCK-EARLYBIRD-1025 until September 25th to claim your discoun
 tUltra Textural Weaving on a Unique SubstrateInstructor: Vicki Assegued Wh
 ere: Sebastopol Center for the Arts When: Sunday\, October 25th - 10:00am-
 3:00pmPrice: $100 registration + $25 Materials Fee Class Description: You
 ’ll learn many techniques for weaving\, knotting\, wrapping\, tying\, se
 wing\, coiling and twisting of fiber materials to build our dynamic and st
 unning pieces to hang on the wall.The surprising and versatile foundation 
 for the weaving is plastic fencing\, which opens the creative journey into
  much more than ordinary weaving.You'll have access to plastic fencing\, m
 any gorgeous fabrics and yarns\, beads\, buttons and other decorations to 
 add to your piece.You’ll also make fringe\, tassels and pompoms to add t
 exture and delight. No art or weaving experience is necessary\, and all le
 vels are most welcome.(If you've taken Vicki's other weaving workshop\, pl
 ease note that this will be a very different workshop\, with plenty of new
  techniques to learn and outcomes to explore).Please bring: Sewing needle 
 and thread\, Fabric Scissors (If you have them)Optional: You’re encourag
 ed to bring materials from your own stash including fabrics\, used clothin
 g\, yarn\, string\, lace\, ribbon\, beads\, old jewelry parts and other de
 corations.Feel Inspired? Join all three of Vicki’s upcoming classes for 
 $15.00 off each class\, and save $25 in materials!Sunday Oct 25\, 2026 - U
 ltra Textural Weaving on a Unique Substrate Sunday Dec 13\, 2026 - Stuffe
 d and Decorated Vessels Saturday Jan 30\, 2027 - Fibers Beyond the FrameA
 bout the Instructor: Vicki Assegued is an experimental and innovative fibe
 r artist and instructor\, always finding new and unique ways to work with 
 textiles and fibers. Through her creative process\, she explores many ways
  to weave\, layer\, attach\, coil\, tie\, knot\, twist\, build and develop
  her pieces so they are vibrant and engaging. She then shares all of her t
 echniques with her students\, supporting and inspiring them to fully engag
 e in their own creative process of discovery and expression. Vicki teaches
  at art schools and retreats around the country\, such as the Art & Soul M
 ixed Media Retreat\, the Mendocino Art Center\, North Country Studio Works
 hops and the San Jose Museum of Quilts & Textiles. Vicki completed a 4-mon
 th residency with the Santa Cruz Recycled Art Program. She has exhibited a
 nd sold her work at galleries\, businesses\, health centers\, restaurants\
 , community centers\, museums\, and open studio events. You can learn more
  about Vicki here: https://www.vickiart.com/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n              
